(#$cyclistNotes #$repliesTo-Communicating "The predicate has been so named in order to leave room
for terms--probably generalizations--which would denote looser and
more metaphorical senses of 'reply' that would not be restricted to
what would have to be considered strict communications.  Thus, we
might want to talk about 'replies' in the geopolitical arena, such
that a country's massing troops along its border could be counted as a
'reply' to a neighboring country's test-firing a missile, or something
of the sort.  There is a sense in which a more serious problem is
being glossed: namely, virtually any instance of #$Action can probably
be analyzed as an instance of #$Communicating, given the right
assumptions and circumstances.") 
