(#$comment #$OrgTypeByGeoAndBOSFn "This function enables us to refer to instances of the
#$ModernMilitaryOrganization partition #$MilitaryOrgTypeByGeoAndBOS.
More specifically, (#$OrgTypeByGeoAndBOSFn GEO-AGENT BOS) returns the
collection of all #$ModernMilitaryOrganizations that are
#$subOrganizations of the instance of BOS that has GEO-AGENT as the
#$sovereignAllegianceOfOrg.  Thus, e.g., (#$OrgTypeByGeoAndBOSFn
#$France #$Army-BranchOfService) returns the collection of all French
army units.") 
(#$comment #$Path-InfoTransfer "The collection of all instances of #$Path-Customary constructed primarily             for the purpose of allowing the transfer of information, i.e. for being            a #$deviceUsed and an #$infoPathway-Partial in instances of            #$InformationTransferEvent  (though this does not            preclude them from being used for other purposes).  Examples include instances            of #$FiberOpticCable, #$TelephoneLine, etc.  Instances of, say, #$Highway or            #$Railway would not be examples, since, even though one could transfer            information along an instance of,say, #$Railway, these are not constructed            primarily for this purpose.") 
