(#$comment #$Signal "A subset of #$InformationBearingThing (IBT).
Every instance of #$Signal is an IBT intended to convey some specific
information.  In contrast are IBTs generated unintentionally or
without intention, such as inadvertent belches, rocks containing
fossil records, and radio waves generated by quasars.  For more
