(#$comment #$Agent-CoABS "All #$Agent-CoABS are on the #$Grid-CoABS. Agents-CoABS manifest various examples of #$AgentCapacity-CoABS, such as: translators, brokers, matchmakers, domain managers and subcontractors with specialized roles, e.g. ability to plan routes or find weather information. Each #$Agent-CoABS has a #$Resume-CoABS.  While human agents utilize the grid, it is assumed that human interaction with grid agents is mediated by software which can then be considered as a proxy #$SoftwareAgent for the human user.  Or, for purposes of grid tasks, the agency of the human might be ignored.") 
