      parties who do not play a direct role in the conflict; (2) other
      countries that experience side-effects from the conflict such as
      the spill-over of fighting, cross-border troop/guerrilla
      movement/activity, refugee movements, or political/economic
      instability; and (3) other states, groups, individuals, or
      multinational organizations involved in mediation or
