(#$comment #$SKF-2713720 "All rules involving #$SKF-3433560 #$SKF-2713720 #$SKF-52188152 are generated by one          assertion which says that if ?sub is a subsystem of          ?sys, and if each link between ?x and ?y in ?sys is a          link between ?x and ?y in ?sub (provided ?x and ?y          are in ?sub), then ?sub is a link-losed subsystem of          ?sys. The assertion is: (implies (and          (subPathSystems ?sys ?sub) (forAll ?x (forAll ?y          (forAll ?link (implies (and (linkBetweenInSystem ?link          ?x ?y ?sys) (pointInSystem ?x ?sub) (pointInSystem          ?y ?sub)) (linkBetweenInSystem ?link ?x ?y          ?sub)))))) (linkClosedSubSystems ?sys ?sub)).") 
