(#$comment #$EvaluatingWithRespectToAnAttributeType "Instances of #$EvaluatingWithRespectToAnAttributeType are
instances of #$Evaluating in which a thing is evaluated with regard
to its possession of an attribute of a given type.  Examples include
evaluating an object with respect to #$Color, #$Strength, or #$Mass.
So, for example, the object of evaluating a thing THING with respect to the
attribute type #$Strength is to determine some value STR of #$Strength such
that (#$hasAttributes THING STR) holds.") 
