(#$comment #$inPreparationFor "(#$inPreparationFor ACT EVENT) means that the
#$Action ACT is done in conscious preparation for the #$Event EVENT.
ACT starts before EVENT.  ACT may continue after EVENT begins, but it
doesn't continue past EVENT.  ACT may be a necessary precondition for
EVENT, such as booking a hall or caterers for a wedding reception, but
it may also be something incidental, such as dressing up for the
reception.  Cf. #$preconditionFor-Events.") 
