(#$comment #$resumeField-History "(#$resumeField-History ?RESUME ?STRING) means that the string is an  account of the history of the #$Agent-CoABS. This is inscribed on the agent's #$Resume-CoABS. The history should include which communities the agent joined,  and its success in helping the community. If it was unsuccessful, then there should be an account of why. This is so that the agent is not branded as  incompetant just on the basis of lack of success. For, the agent may fail for reasons ad hoc to the agent, such as a power failure. The inscription  may be in a language other than CycL. The inscription might be inscribed by  an agent other than the owner of the resume.") 
