(#$comment #$MissionSpecificationMicrotheory "The collection of all instance of #$Plan such that the means
and ends detailed constitute the mission of a
#$ModernMilitaryOrganization.  'Mission' is used here in a loose sense
that accomodates both the long-term and near-term missions of a unit,
and also short-term courses-of-action that might be prepared in a
combat theater environment (see #$COASpecificationMicrotheory).  The
collection is a specialization of both #$Plan and #$Obligation, since
it is believed that a 'mission' presupposes an obligation on the part
of someone to carry it out.") 
