(#$comment #$rolePlayerMaintainsCondition "(#$rolePlayerMaintainsCondition ROLE COND) means that if an
actor that plays ROLE in a #$FunctionalSystem, for the duration of the
time that the actor plays ROLE the actor's actions will be directed
toward making sure that COND remains true for the extent of the time
that ROLE is played.  At a minimum, this means that the default
#$purposeOfEvent of any action the actor does while playing ROLE will
be that COND holds for the duration of the role-playing.  Also, if the
actor is an #$IntelligentAgent,the default #$purposeInEvent that the
actor has for any action he, she, or it performs will be that COND
holds for the duration of the role-playing.") 
