(#$cyclistNotes #$PurposeSpecificationSlot "The instances of #$PurposeSpecificationSlot are
homologous with the instances of #$SuccessCriterionSlot.  However,
while the expansions of the latter are cashed out in terms of
#$successfulForAgents, those of the former reference #$purposeOfPlan
and #$purposeOfEvent.  There is a significant conceptual distinction
between stating the criteria according to which a plan or action is to
be judged 'successful', and stating the purpose or goal state the plan
or action is supposed to bring about.") 
