essentially as bulletin boards for posting messages that some 
instances of #$Agent-CoABS can read. Messages on a CoABS bulletin
board can include advertisements to register with a matchmaker or 
broker, calls for solutions to problems, simple searches, etc. 
A CoABS bulletin board has an address. It might require a manager.
