(#$comment #$FancifulTaskPrerequisitesMt "This microtheory contains numerous made-up facts concerning
essential prerequisites of military tasks, to be used entirely for
purposes of testing.  If these facts were known to be true, this would
be a #$PhaseIIBattlespaceSource-PIT, located between the
ModernMilitaryTacticsMt and the BattlespaceMilitaryMt in the genlMt
hierarchy.  However, since we do not want the conclusions available in
this microtheory to be propagated to battlespace work in general, it
is being made a dependent of the BattlespaceMilitaryMt.  The
TaskDependenciesTestMt is in turn being made a dependent of it.") 
