(#$comment #$relationExistsMinInstance "(#$relationExistsMinInstance PRED COL1 INS2 N) means that, there exists at least N instances (INS1) of COL1 that have the relation PRED with INS2, i.e. (PRED INS1 INS2) holds.  #$relationExistsMinInstance is thus redundant with a huge set of commonly-occurring rules. One must be aware of the implicit quantification underlying this predicate. ") 
