(#$comment #$MarineExpeditionaryUnit "A specialization of #$ExpeditionaryUnit-MilitarySpecialty, each instance
  of which is one of the #$subOrganizations of the #$UnitedStatesMarineCorps.
  An instance of #$MarineExpeditionaryUnit (an MEU) consists of about 2,200 instances
  of #$MarinePersonnel, and comprises a reinforced battalion, a composite aircraft
  squadron, and an MEU Service Support group.  Commanded by a colonel, an MEU is
  employed to fulfill routine forward deployments with fleets in the Mediterranean,
  the Western Pacific, and periodically, the Atlantic and Indian Oceans.  An MEU is
  deployed on up to four Naval amphibious ships.  See also #$MarineExpeditionaryForce.") 
