(#$comment #$DASSAEvent8Sub1-JanitorDiscoveredAtDLAForward "An off-duty DLA Forward G6 staff member returning to his  office observes a Tamborine national employed by their janitorial  contractor removing and replacing a network hub on the DLA's sensitive  but unclassified LAN, and reports the incident to the MPs.  The  Janitor is subsequently arrested when leaving the premises, and is  discovered to have two network hubs on his person whose exteriors are  identical to the JTF standard.  The interiors have been modified to  incorporate a device capabale of capturing and storing up to 10 days'  worth of network traffic on a miniaturized hard disk.") 
