(#$comment #$SKF-18650386 "All rules involving #$SKF-18650386 are  generated by one assertion which says that if ?sub is a link-closed  subsystem of ?sys, and if ?sys is a multi graph, then each path in  ?sys is in ?sub if all nodes in ?sys on the path are in ?sub.  The  assertion is:  (implies     (and      (linkClosedSubSystems ?sys ?sub)      (isa ?sys MultiGraph)      (pathBetweenInSystem ?path ?x ?y ?sys)      (forAll ?z       (implies        (and         (pointOnPath ?z ?path)         (nodeInSystem ?z ?sys))        (nodeInSystem ?z ?sub))))     (pathBetweenInSystem ?path ?x ?y ?sub)).") 
