(#$comment #$meansOfInfoTransfer "This predicate is a more specific version of #$instrument-Generic intended to single           out those instances of #$Artifact-Generic that play the role of #$instrument-Generic           in instances of #$InformationTransferEvent and that are specifically designed to           aid in information transfer.  (#$meansOfInfoTransfer ITE ART) means           that the #$Artifact-Generic ART plays an instrumental role in the            #$InformationTransferEvent ITE and that ART was created in           part to be able to play such roles, i.e.           (#$intendedBehaviorCapable ART #$InformationTransferEvent #$instrument-Generic)           holds.  For example, if some instance TEL of            #$Telephone is used in a successful telephone call CALL, then we could           represent this with (#$meansOfInfoTransfer CALL TEL).") 
