(#$comment #$RatifyingAnInternationalAgreement "The collection of all acts of ratifying an instance of #$InternationalAgreement.
  Instances of #$RatifyingAnInternationalAgreement are typically performed by an instance of
  #$RegionalGovernment or by the #$governingBody of an instance of #$PoliticalOrganization.
  An instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity's being one of the #$signatories with respect to an
  international agreement is normally a necessary condition for ratification by the entity's
  government, while ratification by its government is itself normally both necessary and
  sufficient for a geopolitical entity's being one of the #$agreeingAgents to the agreement.
  (Similar relationships hold with respect to political organizations whose governing bodies
  ratify international agreements.)") 
