(#$comment #$increasesImmediately "(#$increasesImmediately
PERIOD THING SLOT) means that the value for the predicate SLOT applied
to THING (in the first argument position) is greater immediately after
(#$STIF q.v.) PERIOD than it was immediately before (#$STIB q.v.)
PERIOD.  PERIOD may be any instance of #$TemporalThing, i.e., anything
that has a time period associated with it, whether an event, an
entity, a life stage, etc. No causal connection is implied between the
#$TemporalThing PERIOD and the increase.  See
#$NoteAboutQuantityChangePredicates for a map of related predicates.") 
