(#$comment #$OAStatusCheckerGraphMt "In this microtheory we set out the sufficient conditions for various conversation statuses in an #$OfferAcceptConversation.  This is a #$ConvPolicyGraphRulesMt which sets out the sequencing requirements for avoiding violation status.  The intention here is to clearly separate out issues of sequencing from other conversation policy rules.  If a policy has to do with issues other than sequencing it should be stated in #$OAStatusCheckerGraphMt or in an analogous mt.  Ultimately, each different conversation policy issue could be a separate mt, but for our purposes here I separate out sequencing rules in one mt and all other rules in a second mt.  This microtheory is very similar to #$OAStatusCheckerMt except that it presupposes a graph theoretic representation of the relevant conversation policy.  This alters the rules from those in  #$OAStatusCheckerMt slightly.") 
