(#$comment #$favorableFor "(#$favorableFor CIRC AGENT ACT_TYPE) means that the situation CIRC is
a normally favorable circumstance for AGENT to perform an instance of
ACT_TYPE. For example, normal external circumstances for playing the piano
would be those in which one has access to a piano in reasonably good shape,
is awake, alert, lacking physical disabilities, not underwater, etc. The
idea is that this is the kind of situation in which a person skilled at
ACT-TYPE would have a good chance to perform succesfully an action of type
ACT_TYPE.") 
