a #$Situation of type SIT_TYPE does not obtain at the start the
execution of PLAN, then such a situation must be prevented throughout
PLAN, in order for PLAN to count as successful. The predicate is
defined in terms of #$toStopInPlan-SitType and
#$toPreventInPlan-SitType.") 
