(#$comment #$structureMapAnyMt "(#$structureMapAnyMt ?Src ?Tgt ?Src-Desc ?Tgt-Desc) returns a structure-mapping of the formulae in ?Src-Mt pertaining to the source concept ?Src that are isomorphic with formulae in ?Tgt-Mt that pertain to the target domain concept ?Tgt. The mappings are condensed as formulae, so ?Src-Desc becomes bound to an and of all the matching formulae in the source domain, while ?Tgt-Desc becomes bound to an and of all the matching formulae in the target domain. See also #$structureMap, a version of this predicate in which the structure-mapping process is restricted to axioms available in specified microtheories only.") 
