(#$comment #$Hacker "The collection of people who willfully attempt to 
access, use, or affect a #$ComputationalSystem without authorization.  
Hackers may also be authorized users of a system that attempt to 
use or affect the system in a manner that is not consistent with its normal
operation or intended use. Hackers attack computational systems using
computers--someone who crashes their computer by beating it with a bat or
pouring water on it would not be a hacker.  Hackers use the resources--input
devices, drives, programs, operations, etc--of a computer to hack it, 
or they use one computer's resources to hack another") 
