(#$comment #$InternationalOrganizationDataMt "This is the microtheory
in which one ought to put in information about international organizations
which countries and governments can be members of,
such as the #$UnitedNationsOrganization, #$INTERPOL, and #$OPEC. Also 
included are organizations that have international scope, such as #$HAMAS. 
Borderline case: information about organizations like the #$UnitedStatesAirForce,
which are national organizations but have international scope.
The general policy to follow: if information about the organization
is relevant to reasoning about international affairs, put it in
this mt.") 
