(#$comment #$casualtyCountByAilment "(#$casualtyCountByAilment EVT WHAT AILMENT NUM) means that as a result of the event EVT, the number of WHAT who are suffering with the physical condition AILMENT is NUM.  WHAT is a type of #$Organism-Whole, and AILMENT is a type of #$AilmentCondition.  The subsets of #$AilmentCondition cover injuries as well as illnesses, allergies, and psychological disorders.  Note that an organism that suffers from some instance of an ailment is the #$bodilyDoer of that ailment instance.  Examples:  #$casualtyCountByAilment may be used to state the number of persons who are afflicted by smoke inhalation in a particular fire, the number who contract food poisoning from a family picnic, or the number who suffer shell shock as a result of a particular battle.") 
