(#$comment #$SKF-13631033 "All rules involving #$SKF-13631033 or #$SKF-49740826 are generated by one assertion which says that if a  node in a path system SYS is on no links nor loops in SYS, then it  is an isolated node in SYS.  The assertion is:   (implies     (and      (nodeInSystem ?x ?sys)      (forAll ?link       (implies        (linkInSystem ?link ?sys)        (not (pointOnPath ?x ?link))))      (forAll ?loop       (implies        (loopInSystem ?loop ?sys)        (not (pointOnCycle ?x ?loop)))))     (isolatedNodeInSystem ?x ?sys)).") 
