(#$comment #$RestrictedInformation "#$RestrictedInformation is information
that is the legal or assumed property of an individual or group and
whose unauthorized distribution or availability is not allowed, presumably
because it has value to the individual or group and its value would
diminish if distributed or made available to others. Note that
#$RestrictedInformation will usually also be
