(#$cyclistNotes #$moreThwartedFromBecause "The rules for this predicate are set up so that we are
able to conclude (#$moreThwartedFromBecause AGENT EVTTYPE ROLE PROP)
from the knowledge that (#$decreasedChanceForRoleBecause AGENT EVTTYPE
ROLE PROP) and the knowledge that (#$goals AGENT (ROLE EVTTYPE
AGENT)). Conclusions about thwarting are thus linked directly to
conclusions about risk and the goals of agents.") 
