(#$comment #$DictionaryPasswordVulnerability "A collection of vulnerabilities for instances of
#$ComputationalSystem, as well as accounts on such systems.  An
account on a computational system has a #$DictionaryPasswordVulnerability
if the #$Password-Computer is a word found in a standard dictionary.
This is a vulnerability because several computer hacking programs work
by trying to logig in using dictionary terms.  If an account has a
#$DictionaryPasswordVulnerability, then the computational system housing the
account also has that vulnerability.") 
