(#$comment #$resumeField-Origin "(#$resumeField-Origin RESUME ADDRESS) 
 means that the designer of the agent possessing RESUME can be contacted
 at ADDRESS.  Having this information on one's resume is especially 
 important for software agents when they first arrive on the 
 #$Grid-CoABS. This is because they won't yet have a history, so the 
 best indicators of their reliability will be their origins.  Also, 
 if the agent is prone to malfunction in the early stages, the best 
 people to repair it will be those who created it.  Thus, it is useful 
 to fill in this field with an e-mail address or URL for contacting the
 place of origin.") 
