(#$comment #$terminalOfTrans-Generic "(#$terminalOfTrans-Generic TRANS THING) means that THING marks one of the             terminal points in the #$GeneralizedTransfer TRANS, either its             beginning or its end.  For example, consider a trip TRANS from Austin to             Omaha, NE.  In this case, it would correct to assert both             (#$terminalOfTrans-Generic TRANS #$CityOfAustinTX) and              (#$terminalOfTrans-Generic TRANS #$CityOfOmahaNB).  Compare to             #$to-Generic and #$from-Generic.  #$terminalOfTrans-Generic is             a generalization of both of these predicates.") 
