(#$comment #$actionFulfillsObligation "(#$actionFulfillsObligation ACT OB)
means that the #$Action ACT fulfills the #$Obligation OB. Note that this is
stronger than an action merely being in conformity with some obligation,
but is supposed to indicate that an action somehow positively fulfills
an obligation. For instance, paying the minimum balance owed on my #$CreditCard
would fulfill my financial obligation to the credit card company, but it
would not fulfill my obligation to honor my father and mother, although it
is not in conflict with that obligation.") 
