(#$comment #$oppositeFunction "(#$oppositeFunction FUNCTION OPP-FUNCTION) is used in inferences which involve quantities which are negatively related to one another.  For example, barometric pressue is inversely dependent on altitude above sea level.  Similarly, class rank in college is inversely correlated with SAT score.  Thus, the #$oppositeFunction of a geometrically increasing function would be a geometrically decreasing function.  The #$oppositeFunction of a net increasing function would be a net decreasing function.  The opposite function of a function involving no net change is a itself.") 
