(#$cyclistNotes #$DeployingAChemicalOrBiologicalAgent "This sense of 'deploying' should not be confused either
with troop deployment (#$Deploying-Military) or the deployment of
hardware such as conventional or nuclear weapons
(#$DeployingMateriel).  One key difference is that these other kinds
of 'deployments' do not presuppose an attack, whereas an instance of
#$DeployingAChemicalOrBiologicalAgent almost certainly does.") 
