(#$comment #$qcAttributeProduct "This predicate is used to compute the effects of a #$QuantitySlot
change in a given direction (#$Positive or #$Negative) on
some dependent #$QuantitySlot.  The first argument expresses the
direction of dependency; the second expresses the direction of change for 
the independent slot;
and the third expresses the net result on the dependent slot.  For instance,
(#$qcAttributeProduct #$Negative #$Positive #$Negative) means that a
negative dependency x a positive change results in a negative change
for the dependent slot.") 
