(#$comment #$entailsRoleInEventOfType "The purpose of this predicate is to relate #$SystemSlots
(i.e., relations representing functional roles) to their corresponding
#$ActorSlots (i.e., relations representing the roles that agents play
in events).  (#$entailsRoleInEventOfType SYS-SLOT EVENT-TYPE
SYS-ACT-SLOT AGT-ACT-SLOT) means that if an agent plays the functional
role SYS-SLOT in a particular functional system, and that system in
turn plays the role SYS-ACT-SLOT in an event of type EVENT-TYPE, then
the agent will play the role AGT-ACT-SLOT in that same event.") 
