(#$comment #$MissionCriticalInformation "#$MissionCriticalInformation is information that is of
highest importance in the fulfillment of the
attacker's mission.  #$MissionCriticalInformation might overlap with
other kinds of information, but note that it would not be superfluous
merely because electronic intelligence attacks can always be
construed as attacks whose object is 'mission critical' data, by
virtue of being the information sought in the attack in question.
#$MissionCriticalInformation must be information whose 'content' has
direct value on the success of an attacker's mission, whether the
mission be the attack itself, or some other attack that the
information is intended to facilitate.") 
