(#$comment #$outcomeOfAction "This predicate expresses the relation between an action (done in
a given circumstance) and its outcome. The statement (#$outcomeOfAction ACT
AG PROP) is true iff PROP expresses the value-relevant results of ACT, i.e.,
the results of the action that are relevant with respect to evaluation on
AG's part. Though we ultimately need this predicate to represent success
conditions for an action, we do not require here that AG be the actual
performer of ACT.") 
