(#$comment #$HeavyDrySupportBridge "Each #$HeavyDrySupportBridge (HDSB) is a modular bridge that can span a 40 meter gap in 90 minutes with 14 or fewer soldiers.  One bridge set provides either one 40 meter bridge or two 20 meter bridges.  The bridge will cross MLC 96W/70T traffic and allows the crossing of a Heavy Equipment Transporter carrying an M1A1 tank.  The HDSB is designed for transportation as a palletized load by a CommonBridgeTransporter, Palletized Load System (PLS) trailers or by service support units equipped with PLS trucks.  A bridge set will consist of no more than 9 PLS pallet loads and a launcher vehicle. (Source: Engineer Systems Handbook, 4/97)") 
