(#$comment #$toUpholdInPlan-SitType "(#$toUpholdInPlan-SitType PLAN SIT_TYPE) means that if a
#$Situation of type SIT_TYPE does not obtain at the start of the
execution ofPLAN, then it must be brought about some time in the
course of the execution of PLAN, and if a #$Situation of type SIT_TYPE
does obtain at the start of the execution ofPLAN, then it must be
maintained throughout PLAN, in order for PLAN to count as
successful. The predicate is defined in terms of
#$toMaintainInPlan-SitType and #$toInsureInPlan-SitType.") 
