(#$comment #$knownFormula "(#$knownFormula PROP) means that PROP is provable and that the truth of PROP can be checked by determining whether all of the assertions in a finite set are already known in the Knowledge Base.  In cases where PROP makes a universal claim, this is equivalent to saying that we do not need to resort to a universal generalization proof to establish the truth of PROP--a finite check on the system's explicit knowledge is sufficient to establish the universal result.") 
