(#$comment #$SystemCondition "The collection of #$Events in which a
system (biological organism, computer network, etc) undergoes
some state or process, which may be normal or abnormal. An instance of
#$SystemCondition is, especially, a dynamic state that (1) has important
temporal aspects, and/or (2) affects the system's condition for a
significant period of time, such that (a) the condition may be thought
of as an `episode' in the existence of the system or even (b) a
permanent aspect of the system.  #$SystemCondition is the most general
collection of such states.") 
