(#$comment #$Device-RemoteControlled "A collection. The instances of #$Device-RemoteControlled are those devices which can be controlled remotely when they are being used. For every instance of this collection there is an instance of #$RemoteControlDevice with which to do the controlling. Examples are some instances of #$TelevisionSet of which the channels, volume, etc. can be controlled remotely. Also many instances of #$TransportationDevice-Unmanned can be guided by remote control. This control need not happen throughout the event of using the device. An example of this are the laser-guided missiles that are only guided at the end by pointing with the laser to the intended target.") 
