(#$comment #$suppliedWithFromExclusivelyThrough "(#$suppliedWithFromExclusivelyThrough PT1 COL PT2 PT3) means that the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT1 is supplied with instances of the #$Collection COL from the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT2 through the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT3 (on their way from PT2 to PT1), and that PT1 is supplied with instances of COL from PT2 only through PT3.  Like the predicate #$suppliedWith (q.v.), #$suppliedWithFromExclusivelyThrough is very general.  In various assertions PT1 might, for instance, be a #$Cell, a #$Person, a #$Business, or a #$GeographicalRegion; and likewise for PT2.  And PT3 might, for example, be a #$Hose, a #$Railway, a #$GeographicalRegion, or a #$BloodVessel.  The range of possible supplies is similarly broad.") 
