(#$comment #$valuesAttitude "(#$valuesAttitude AGENT PROP SUBJ-ATTR) expresses the fact that
AGENT projects on the state of affairs expressed by PROP the evaluative
attitude characterized by SUBJ-ATTR. Such attitudes may be identified with
stances of a more or less emotive nature, or with reasoned evaluative
judgments. Entities capable of taking evaluative stances are entities
capable of manifesting interests in purposeful action, hence the
restriction of the first argument to #$Agent.") 
