(#$comment #$NoteAboutCausalityPredicates "To represent causation
between individual events, see #$causes-EventEvent. To represent
causation between propositions, use #$causes-PropProp.  See
#$causes-SitProp to express a causal link between a #$Situation and a
proposition (a CycFormula). See #$causes-PropProp to express a causal
link between one proposition and another.  Although not very
appropriate for assertions, the predicate #$causes-ThingProp may be used in queries to collect the widest variety of causal antecedents to some propositionally stated effect.") 
