(#$cyclistNotes #$agentViolatesObligation "It would be helpful if it were true that whenever an agent violates an obligation, there is some action such that (i) it is performed by the agent, and (ii) that action violates the obligation the agent violated. I.e., the truth of the following would be helpful: (#$implies (#$agentViolatesObligation ?AGENT ?OB) (#$thereExists ?ACTION (#$and (#$performedBy ?ACTION ?AGENT) (#$actionViolatesObligation ?ACTION ?OB)))).") 
