(#$comment #$proxyEnforcer-FunctionalRole "(#$proxyEnforcer-FunctionalRole SYSTEM AGENT) means that there is a supersystem SUPER such that (#$subGroups SUPER SYSTEM) and (#$different SUPER SYSTEM) and such that (#$enforcer-FunctionalRole SUPER AGENT).  This predicate is applicable in cases of enforcement function where the executive whose edicts are being enforced is executive of a system that subsumes the system in which the enforcement is happening, and is the common generalization of a number of more specialized roles, such as #$politicalCommisar.") 
