(#$cyclistNotes #$MediaTransmitting "Q. Why is #$MediaTransmitting a spec of #$IBTGeneration-Replication? A. The IBTs transmitted in a #$MediaTransmitting event are human-accessible sounds and/or images emitted by receiving devices. So the collection of IBTs that is the #$publishedThing in a #$MediaTransmitting event is the collection of sounds and/or images emitted by all devices receiving the transmission.  Compare #$PrintCirculationEvents, where the replication of the IBOs precedes their distribution: In #$MediaTransmitting, the IBTs' replication and transfer are the same event.") 
