(#$cyclistNotes #$intraGroupSlotCorrespondsToLinkInSystem "The arg1 position is currently restricted to symmetric predicates.  That is because of the strong biconditional definition: linkBetweenInSystem is symmetric between the second and third arguments.  We do not yet know to what degree this will limit the scope and utility of the predicate. If we want a broader arg1Isa, the definition will either have to be weakened, or else we will need to introduce a 'linkBetween' predicate that is agnostic as to symmetry, allowing for, among other things, 'directed links'.") 
