(#$comment #$acknowledgementOf "(#$acknowledgementOf ?ACT ?PIT) means that ?ACT is an acknowledging act to signify receipt of the abstract information ?PIT that is being acknowledged and to indicate a response.  The ?ACT may be an #$Accepting-CommunicationAct or a #$Rejecting-CommunicationAct, or several others.  Some may be combinations, e.g. David may accept part of #$Wanda's order (say the part about cleaning the kitchen) but not the other part (say cleaning the bathroom).  See also #$acknowledgedAct which relates the two acts directly.") 
