(#$comment #$Scavenging-Recon "#$Scavenging-Recon is a subset of #$ResearchProject and #$Stealing-Information.  It is the collection of all events that involve searching through trash to acquire sensative data (individuals in the collection #$SecurityInfo)without authorization.  Such events are often precursors to events in the collection #$AttackByComputerOperation, if they result in the discovery of, e.g., protected computer passwords. They may also lead to events in the collection  #$AttackByComputerOperation more indirectly if they result in the discovery of personal information that could be used to guess a password or to perform  more effectively an event in the collection #$SocialEngineering.") 
