(#$comment #$VitalNationalInterest "The #$GoalAttribute used to characterize national interests crucial to a country's survival and of direct concern to its military forces.  Examples of such interests include: maintaining a country's territorial integrity, guaranteeing the well-being of its citizens, guranteeing the security of its allies.  This classification is motivated by the taxonomy presented in the Internation System Framework document prepared by IET-PSR (available in 1998-1999 at http://www.iet.com/Projects/HPKB/resources.html).") 
