of #$JesusOfNazareth after the #$CrucifixionOfJesus, or the resurrection of 
Lazarus by #$JesusOfNazareth in the new testament. Currently, this concept is
defined relative to the religious (i.e., #$Christianity) interpretation of
#$Resurrection, and should probably not be used in non-religious contexts 
(e.g., a doctor resurrecting a patient who 'died' twenty-seconds ago). However,
