(#$comment #$g2ForCOA "The G2 or S2 (intelligence officer) produces the IPB
(intelligence preparation of the battlefield) products that are vital
to Course of Action development, including potential Courses of Action
for the #$Red-Side. Without these, the G3/S3 and the rest of the staff
cannot proceed with course of action development. Sometimes this means
that the IPB products are initial estimates only, and will be refined
as the estimate process continues. Nonetheless, all of these products
are necessary for producing or understanding courses of action. In
wargaming, the G3 directs the blue fight and the G2 conducts the red
fight.") 
