(#$comment #$SKF-63562160 "All rules involving  #$SKF-61939324 or #$SKF-63562160 are generated by one assertion  which says that if ?sub is a subsystem of ?sys, and if all points in  ?sys on a link in ?sys are in ?sub whenever the link is in ?sub, then  ?sub is a point-closed subsystem of ?sys.  The assertion is:  (implies     (and      (subPathSystems ?sys ?sub)      (forAll ?link       (forAll ?x        (implies         (and          (linkInSystem ?link ?sub)          (pointInSystem ?x ?sys)          (pointOnPath ?x ?link))         (pointInSystem ?x ?sub)))))     (pointClosedSubSystems ?sys ?sub)).") 
