(#$comment #$considersAsHome "(#$considersAsHome PERSON PLACE) means that PERSON considers
PLACE his or her home, regardless of whether or not PERSON happens to
reside in PLACE (see #$residesInRegion) currently.  Note that a given
person might simultaneously consider more than one place home in this
sense.  For one thing, someone who considers a small region (e.g. a 
particular #$City) home might also consider a larger surrounding 
region (e.g. the #$State-Geopolitical in which the city is located) 
home as well.  For another thing, some people consider two completely 
seperate places home: their hometown and their current place of
residence, for example.") 
