(#$comment #$StreetSystemOfRegionFn "(#$StreetSystemOfRegionFn REGION) denotes the 
unique maximal street system (if any) SYSTEM that is spread 
throughout much of (and possibly beyond) REGION.  SYSTEM's 
being ''maximally spread'' throughout REGION means that it 
must not be a proper #$subPathSystems of any other 
street system wholly in REGION and covering a larger 
portion of REGION.  (If there were such a larger system, 
presumably, _it_ would be what this function mapped REGION 
to.)  See also #$transPathSystemTypeOfRegion.") 
(#$comment #$DeputyFn "(#$DeputyFn ROLE) returns the #$OrganizationalPosition of
being deputy to an agent playing ROLE.  If (ROLE SYSTEM PERSON) and
((DeputyFn ROLE) SYSTEM DEPUTY), then DEPUTY is PERSON's immediate
#$subordinates and is deputized to act on behalf of or as a
representative of PERSON.") 
