(#$comment #$RequestWhenConversation "A collection of conversations 
involving instances of #$SoftwareAgent.  Such a conversation involves 
a request that an agent perform a certain action if and when a certain
condition becomes true.  The agent may accept or reject the request.
If the agent accepts then, when the condition becomes true, the agent
attempts to perform the requested action and informs the requester of
its success or failure.  The requester may retract the request before
the condition becomes true.") 
