(#$comment #$correspondingCycCollection "(correspondingCycCollection ACTION-PRED ACTION-COLLECTION) means that there is a mapping from the #$ActionPredicate, ACTION-PRED, to some specialization of the Cyc #$Collection, #$Action. More specifically, if (correspondingCycCollection ACTION-PRED ACTION-COLLECTION) holds, then an assertion of the form (ACTION-PRED.TERMS), if made in the context of a #$SituationSpecificationMicrotheory, entails the existence of an instance of of ACTION-COLLECTION. (Please see the #$ActionPredicate for more information. If (PRED.TERMS) is asserted in a PlanSpecificationMicrotheory, it entails that some agents intends that there be an instance of ACTION-COLLECTION.") 
