(#$comment #$BrokeringViolationScenario3Mt "A microtheoretic testing environment whose purpose is to
determine whether Cyc can discern certain types of violation in the
behaviors of so-called 'broker agents'. In this scenario, the 'broker'
agent is represented as acting in accord with the expected behavior of
a broker, and as advertising itself as a broker: however, it does not
in fact have brokering capability in the representation.  We are
presupposing that the Cyc agent has some means of arriving at this
determination, perhaps through some sophisticated form of functional
validation.") 
