(#$comment #$resumeFieldCompletion "(#$resumeFieldCompletion RESUME FIELD STRING)  means that FIELD on RESUME contains STRING.
  Usually, an agent fills in its own fields, but not invariably.  For  example, an agent might not be capable of doing this.  STRING can be written in any language, though it is to the advantage of an agent  that it be in a #$Language which many other agents can understand. It is also an advantage that an agent have as many of its resume  fields filled in as applicable.  GAFs built on #$resumeFieldCompletion might be useful to matchmaker agents, brokering  agents, security agents and others.") 
