(#$comment #$SKF-27572434 "All rules involving #$SKF-27572434 are  generated by one assertion which says that if ?sub is a point-closed  and link-closed subsystem of ?sys, then each path in ?sys is in ?sub  if all points in ?sys on the path are in ?sub.  The assertion is:  (implies     (and      (linkClosedSubSystems ?sys ?sub)      (pointClosedSubSystems ?sys ?sub)      (pathBetweenInSystem ?path ?x ?y ?sys)      (forAll ?z       (implies        (and         (pointOnPath ?z ?path)         (pointInSystem ?z ?sys))        (pointInSystem ?z ?sub))))     (pathBetweenInSystem ?path ?x ?y ?sub)).") 
