(#$comment #$OfficialDocument "A collection of #$InformationBearingObjects (IBOs).  Each element of #$OfficialDocument is a document that can be used as the basis, proof, or support of some fact (such as a person's nationality, marital status, credit, or qualifications; or the ownership or transfer of property; etc.).  Official documents are typically generated, issued, and/or certified by the relevant institutions (as with #$Passports or #$StockCertificates), but they also include unique personal documents (such as wills [#$WillAndTestament]) which meet certain standards to be accepted in support of facts. Examples of #$OfficialDocument: #$BirthCertificates, #$TaxReturns, insurance policies, #$PostageStamps, receipts, #$PackingSlips, student ID cards, etc.") 
