(#$comment #$MilitaryOrgTypeByEchelonGeoAndBOS "This type-level collection forms an important partition on
#$ModernMilitaryOrganization. For each possible combination of a #$MilitaryEchelon instance (e.g. #$Platoon-UnitDesignation), a
#$GeographicalAgent instance (e.g. #$France) and a #$BranchOfMilitaryService
spec (#$Army-BranchOfService, #$Navy, #$AirForce, etc.),
#$MilitaryOrgTypeByEchelonGeoAndBOS has an instance, comprising all and only
those #$ModernMilitaryOrganizations of the level of the #$MilitaryEchelon instance which are #$subOrganizations of an instance of the #$BranchOfMilitaryService spec that has the #$GeographicalAgent instance as #$sovereignAllegianceOfOrg.  E.g.,  collection of all Iranian air force squadrons.  See also #$OrgTypeByEchelonGeoAndBOSFn.") 
