(#$comment #$TestBrowsingAndResultsMt "This mt is the #$genlMt of all elements of #$TestQuestionMicrotheory.  It is intended to serve two main purposes. It allows easy recording of the status of a query, e.g. did it work?, when was it shown to work?.  E.g. information that constants like #$cpAnswerableQuery used to provide.  It allows easy asking of queries which range over #$TestQuestionMicrotheory such as 'show me all of elements of #$TestQuestionMicrotheory for which #$BillJ is a #$testCyclistsResponsible.'.  This ease of asking becomes important for complex queries such as 'show me questions with #$BillJ as #$testCyclistsResponsible that have gone from the #$testStatus-Automatic of #$Hit-Exact to #$MissedSome which have #$testStatus-Manual of #$Hit-Exact.'") 
