(#$cyclistNotes #$eventDisregarded "Further explication of what it means for something to be 'ignored' is needed in CycL.  It isn't simply a matter of an agent 'failing to recognize something': rather the thing ignored is almost always recognized in some terms, just not in terms of certain key implications it has w.r.t. some plan or goal of the agent's.  This suggests that something more complex than a slot is needed to address this concept in the long term.") 
