(#$comment #$threatCoerces "In #$Threats, 
the form often is: 'Unless you do this,  I'll do that.'  
The  'you do this' part (what the threatener is trying to 
get the threatened to do) is the arg2 of  #$threatCoerces.
Often this will be an #$Action, but other times it may be
refraining from an action, or something else. 
Note that the arg2Isa is a formula.  See also #$threatens.") 
