(#$comment #$UpwardMonotoneForCapMt "Suppose that (behaviorCapable AGENT ACT_TYPE ROLE), that
(genls ACT_TYPE SUPERACT_TYPE), and that (genlPreds ROLE SUPERROLE).
There are many contexts in which we will wish to conclude
(behaviorCapable AGENT SUPERACT_TYPE SUPERROLE), on the interpretation
that (behaviorCapable AGENT ACT_TYPE ROLE) means that AGENT is capable
of some but not necessarily all of the instances of the second
argument.  This microtheory contains rules supporting this inference.
Reasoning contexts which need access to the aforementioned behavior
from behaviorCapable can be given access to this context via a
#$genlMt link.") 
