(#$comment #$intentOfG3InCOA "(#$intentOfG3InCOA G3 COAMT PROP) means that PROP is part of
the intent of the individual serving as the G3 officer in planning
context in which the plan represented by the
#$COASpecificationMicrotheory COAMT is being developed.  The G3's
responsibilities include providing mission analysis products relating
to task organization and specification of purpose: thus nearly
everything in the #$COASpecificationMicrotheory that is not specified
as the #$intentOfCommanderInCOA or the #$intentOfG2InCOA; however, in
practice what is explicitly identified as the #$intentOfG3InCOA will
probably be much less extensive than this.  Use of this predicate does
entail that what is cited as the #$intentOfG3InCOA is also
#$purposeOfPlan for the relevant COA.") 
