(#$comment #$analogicalHypothesis "(#$analogicalHypothesis ?Domain ?Formula)
states that ?Formula is a prediction concerning ?Domain that arises out of
analogical reasoning. That is, the system reasons on the basis of some analogy that
?Formula may hold in a context determined by ?Domain. ?Domain may denote
a microtheory (a true context), or merely some event/scenario that hasn't been
reified as a fully-fledged microtheory. In essence, we use this predicate merely
to mark the analogical provenance of ?Formula, and to ensure that it receives
a nice, explanatory paraphrase.") 
