(#$comment #$testQuestionCycL "(#$testQuestionCycL MT FORMULA) indicates that we want to evaluate (fi-prove FORMULA MT) when performing the test corresponding to MT. Note that fi-prove is equivalent to fi-ask if FORMULA is just a conjunction. For example, (#$testQuestionCycL #$SQ1Mt (#$and (#$isa ?X #$IndependentCountry) (#$bordersOn ?X #$PersianGulf))) just leads to an fi-ask when testing #$SQ1Mt.  All MTs must have a FORMULA specified(but see #$ImageDemoTestMicrotheory), otherwise there is no specified question to be asked.  Please make sure assertions of the form (#$testQuestionCycL MT FORMULA) go are asserted in the microtheory MT.") 
