(#$comment #$PreparingForUndesirableSituation "The collection of #$PurposefulActions in which an agent prepares for a possible situation (#$Situation-Temporal) that is abnormal, undesirable, and forseeable from the point of view of the agent. The action can be entirely mental, as in #$PlanningToDoSomething, or can involve #$CompositePhysicalAndMentalEvents, such as buying extra food as a preparation for a possible supermarket shortage. To relate #$PreparingForUndesirableSituations to the #$Situation-Temporals that they prepare for, use the function #$PreparednessFn. See also #$PreventFromHappening and #$PreventionFn.") 
