(#$comment #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-Information "#$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-Information is the subset of #$AttackByComputerOperation whose instances are
defined by the kind of information that is the object of the attack.
'Kind of information' might be explicated in terms of the value of 
the information to the information-holder, it's value  to
the attacker, whether it is protected, whether it is classified,
whether and to what degree it is restricted, and others.
Examples of specific kinds of information that might become the object
of an #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-Information include
#$ProtectedInformation, #$RestrictedInformation,
#$Classification-US information, #$PublicInformation, #$AccessInformation,
#$SecurityInformation, and perhaps others.") 
