(#$comment #$intermediateOptions "(#$intermediateOptions AGT MEANS
 END) means that END is a goal of AGT, and AGT believes that MEANS is an 'option' available to her to achieve END.  Roughly, AGT believes that MEANS specifies a course of action that she could pursue to achieve END. (More carefully, AGT believes that making the #$CycFormula MEANS true would significantly increase the chances of END becoming true, and AGT believes it is within her power to make MEANS true.) If AGT actually adopts MEANS as a goal for 
purposes of achieving
 END, then (#$intermediateGoals AGT MEANS END) holds.") 
