(#$comment #$economicInterest "(#$economicInterest ?AGENT ?OBJ) means that ?AGENT has ?OBJ as an economic interest.  Examples include trading partners, goods, and trade agreements.  It is important that this predicate not be used to express interest in everything that a particular interest requires.  For example, although one has a trade interest in one's business partners, it is  difficult to see how one has a trade interest in a business partner's  health, although the latter is arguably related to sustaining the  former.") 
