(#$comment #$GridLogReader-AgentCapacity "An instance of #$Agent-CoABS who has the #$AgentCapacity-CoABS           #$GridLogReader-AgentCapacity can read the           #$GridLog-CoABS. This is useful for detecting           problems which arise on the #$Grid-CoABS, for           checking up on other agents, or for historical           reasons. For example, it might be the case that           reading the grid log is the only way of finding out           that a particular sort of problem is re-occuring. A           measure might be implemented to fix the problem,           and once again, the success of the implementation           can only be assessed by reading the grid log.") 
