(#$comment #$increasesCausally "(#$increasesCausally
TEMP-THING THING SLOT) means that TEMP-THING causes the value of the predicate
SLOT applied to THING (in the first argument position) to increase
over some time period after the start of TEMP-THING.  This is defined in
terms of #$increasesCausallyOverPeriod (see also).  Compared with its
value immediately before TEMP-THING, the value of SLOT applied to THING is
guaranteed to be higher immediately following or some time after
TEMP-THING.  This net increase need not be monotonic.  See
#$NoteAboutQuantityChangePredicates for a map of related predicates.") 
