(#$comment #$DevisedPracticeOrWork "The collection of all abstract works which are the
deliberate creations of one or more individuals working in concert.  Such works
are instantiated either in #$PurposefulActions (for instances of #$StructuredActivity-CW) or in #$InformationBearingThing.  Positive examples
include: #$MobyDickNovel (as opposed to any instances of #$BookCopy such that (#$instantiationOfCW #$MobyDickNovel BOOK_COPY), #$Chess (as opposed to games of chess), Beethoven's 9th Symphony (as opposed to any performance of this symphony or any copy of its score). Negative examples include:  paintings (IBOs), customs (not deliberate creations), natural languages (not a deliberate creation), and codes (their uses, not instantiations, are IBTs).  For those works which have associated information formats/structures see #$ConceptualWork.") 
