(#$comment #$allFollowingValueOnScale "(#$allFollowingValueOnScale ATT1 ATT2 SCALE) means that the
instances of #$AttributeValue, ATT1 and ATT2, are part of the
ordering scheme characterized by SCALE.  Note that this is not the same as
asserting (#$followingValueOnScale ATT1 ATT2 SCALE): the latter GAF means
that ATT2 is the 'immediate successor' of ATT1 in the partial ordering
scheme, while in the case where (#$allFollowingValueOnScale ATT1 ATT2
SCALE), ATT1 and ATT2 could be separated by any number of intermediate
nodes, owing to the transitivity of the ordering relation.") 
