(#$comment #$Y1Phase2Stage2-BWAttackAtRasTannurah "The attack with biological weapons implied in the Scenario Stage 2 sentence 'about 24 hours following the attack, U.S. personnel ... confirm the detection of anthrax at the oil facility and at a nearby airbase', and referred to in the Scenario Stage 3 phrase 'including the BW attack at the oil refinery'.  According to Bob Shrag's message, anthrax is detected at Ras Tannurah (the port area) and an airbase nearby.  Assuming that the phrase 'the BW attack at the oil refinery' means 'the BW attack at the oil facility', we take the attack to have happened at the seaport of Ras Tannurah as a part of the #$Y1Stage2-TerroristAttackOnPorts.  As for the airbase, we do not know whether there is another BW attack at the airbase, or the detection of anthrax there is just because the anthrax reaches the airbase through wind, or whatever.") 
