(#$comment #$commonInfectionEntrySite "(#$commonInfectionEntrySite INFECTIONTYPE ORGTYPE
PARTTYPE) means that a common way for instances of ORGTYPE to contract
an INFECTIONTYPE infection is through an #$InfectingEvent that happens
at the ORGTYPE's PARTTYPE. One way to think of this:
(#$commonInfectionEntrySite INFECTIONTYPE ORGTYPE PARTTYPE)
means that if an instance of ORGTYPE is the #$bodilyDoer of an
instance of INFECTIONTYPE, the #$likelihood that the infection began
with an #$InfectingEvent that occurred at an instance of PARTTYPE
belonging to the ORGANISM is #$High, if no other relevant facts are
known.") 
