(#$cyclistNotes #$purposeOfEvent "Although it seems a safe assumption that events only derive purposes from
             rational agents, the issue is not wholly settled. Probably it is the case, and
             probably we have here the essence of one distinction between 'purpose' and
             'mere' functional role. We want to keep an eye on this assumption, however. It
             may not be unrelated to the vexed issue of whether a symbol can derive
             intentionality from a functional role in some system or whether intentionality of a
             symbol implies a purposeful user for the symbol, a debate that has philosophical
             repercussions for AI.") 
