(#$bugtraqDiscussionText #$Bugtraq868 "The help files for the Windows Help system (*.cnt, *.hlp) can be  edited so that they run an   arbitrary executable when selected by a user. The executable will run  at the privelege level of the   user.   The *.cnt files are like tables of contents that tell the help system  what to open when each topic is   selected. These entries can be edited to cause system and DLL calls  and programs to be executed   when a topic is chosen. The help files themselves, *.hlp, can be  edited in a similar manner.") 
