(#$comment #$TransactionalNetwork "An instance of #$PathSystemType-Structural, and a subset of #$Semi-DirectedPathSystem and #$Artifact-Generic. An element of #$TransactionalNetwork is a finite set of linked nodes. The nodes in an instance of #$TransactionalNetwork are agents of some type, either persons or organizations. Some of the nodes in this system are the consumers in some transaction, while other nodes serve as suppliers in that transaction. Finally, there are intermediary nodes in the system; these nodes transfer goods and services from the supplier nodes to the consumer nodes. The links in an instance of #$TransactionalNetwork are the transfers that occur between supplier nodes and intermediary nodes, between intermediary nodes and consumer nodes, or between consumer nodes and either supplier nodes or intermediary nodes.") 
