(#$comment #$dependsOn-Pairwise "This predicate expresses a dependency between two unit-slot pairs.
(#$dependsOn-Pairwise THING1 SLOT1 THING2 SLOT2 DIR) means that the
value of the #$QuantitySlot SLOT1 for THING1 is dependent on the value
of SLOT2 for THING2, in direction DIR.  For instance, to say that
Saudi Arabia's gross domestic product is positively dependent on the
price of oil: (#$dependsOn-Pairwise #$SaudiArabia
#$grossDomesticProduct-Slot #$PetroleumProduct #$basicPriceForType
#$Positive).  See also #$positivelyDependsOn and #$negativelyDependsOn
for collection-level generalizations of this predicate.") 
