(#$cyclistNotes #$repliesTo-CoABSCommunicating "This relation is an inverse spec pred of
#$startsAfterEndingOf.  This means that it is technically impossible,
and not just conversationally procribed, for one #$Agent-CoABS to
'jump the gun' in replying to another #$Agent-CoABS: one agent cannot
reply before another has finished speaking.  If we wish to trap for
such behavior in representations, then the assertions that forbid it
logically must be replaced with assertions that prohibit it
deontologically.") 
