(#$comment #$g3ForCOA "The G3 (S3 for smaller units) is the 'operations
officer'--the person who is in charge of developing and refining Blue
COAs.  His responsibilities during mission analysis include estimating
current combat power for the blue units involved, and specifying the
task organization, the mission and intent up to two levels, the
missions of adjacent units, the relevant constraints for the various
tasks involved, and the refinements of purpose entailed.  In
wargaming, the G3 leads the blue fight and the G2 leads the red
fight.") 
