(#$comment #$objectsObserved "(#$objectsObserved INFORMING OBJECT) means that OBJECT is
observed by the performer or performers of the #$InformationGathering
event INFORMING.  Use of this predicate entails that the information
being gathered relies on an observational or visual component:
however, the information-gathering may be mediated by
instrumentalities, and it is perfectly permissable for the agent doing
the observing to be an instance of #$Organization or #$Group.  Also,
like its specialization, #$objectsPerceived, #$objectsObserved is used
to pick out the real-world 'target' of a real-world 'observation
event'.  It is not used to represent the subjective content of the
observation.") 
