(#$comment #$agentObligationInSituation "(#$agentObligationInSituation AGENT REQUIREMENT SITUATION)
means that AGENT is required to fulfill REQUIREMENT due to its
involvement in SITUATION.  Note that REQUIREMENT is an element of
#$Obligation. If it can not be proven that agent fulfills REQUIREMENT
(see #$agentFulfillsObligation) then (#$agentViolatesObligation AGENT
