an instance of #$Communicating performed and intended to be in answer
to ACT.  We make the default assumption that the performer of the
reply is not the same as the performer of the act to which the reply
is a response.  We also assume that any performer of ACT is the
#$communicationTarget of REPLY, and that the performer of REPLY is
