(#$comment #$weaponEffectiveRange-Min "(#$weaponEffectiveRange-Min WEAPON RANGE) means that RANGE
is the minimum range at which the projectile weapon WEAPON is
considered to be 'effective', ie, capable of doing significant damage
to a target.  Some projectile weapons have specifiable minimum ranges,
while others do not.  It is a particularly useful concept with respect
to certain kinds of #$IndirectFireWeapon which cannot be fired higher
than a certain angle, and which therefore cannot fall inside a certain
circumference.") 
