(#$comment #$LocalizedFn "A unary, collection-denoting function. This function takes as arguments collections that are specs of #$GeometricThing, but are neither specs of #$GeometricThing-Abstract, nor specs of GeometricThing-Localized. Given such a collection, COLL, (#$LocalizedFn COLL) is an instance of #$ExistingObjectType that is also a spec of #$GeometricThing-Abstract collection of all intangible-but-spatially-localized things that we would informally describe as elements of COLL. For example, (#$LocalizedFn #$Rectangle-2D) includes intangible rectangles co-located with cross-sections of rectangular table tops, (#$LocalizedFn #$SphereShape) includes the inatngible sphere with the same dimensions and center as the Sun, and so on. Note that (#$LocalizedFn COLL) is a spec of COLL.") 
